JXQHuaZA6msaeYRqAGwBUNohsLLSSC6kqE--DVSntezw&oe=6AAC03C4"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bLZgz68agl0Q7kNvwEMB_O3&_nc_oc=Adpsc3oiUG420CuLjJqiK6ZpI-Dvsz7QrODGU0OOS943mltrzn9Dc8Cnn1QW3DlSocA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJm-cBDD3YUV6iwk5wW6-7p7hUIyx4Iyj_ZKTD-ASVvQQ&oe=6AABE862"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7Td24-Ca-9YQ7kNvwHt5BVC&_nc_oc=Adof6zaWjtdMbMQhzkmkkg5pEoQuMS4nF7yGmlk_RZHC-e0mY_8YCRiQnFa4E_2g29U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIGlht53vlFfBsXNDZmViJcH6JaCEEplnPGiH2cJWqn-g&oe=6AAC0AB3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DB3TPWyecXoQ7kNvwF-w5uz&_nc_oc=Adqj_U3pl69FvODJNzmlxWyCjBbiAt5Y85l2hnBTPy0e92MALDGIFot6F-6cBwQV-yI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLlAJWD-SVw5OV3JxkZHmyO-HXcdFNB5TZyvG63y7L8SA&oe=6AAC09AF"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OrJrJX8A_n8Q7kNvwGoju9L&_nc_oc=AdrnryT8ADGDhwPV5d7cKi6qmmqWAVCAGHyFjPta3Z5UFxDe1alhaEwk5msu-kNHj0c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK3rz0F9OpwjpvO3wzeDZNYcZYhSBjg73FuoQUq0pec_A&oe=6AAC05A5"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bNtvm_ejkd0Q7kNvwFWhjQh&_nc_oc=AdoCvtdA7Ll0tL_Wv8kAil8mlAy8FhcJLRESr2wproLhhX7pcLDKJpJx_VM3beO-fEs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKPF5FTYLoIt9AuZb69rowS49oqzQU0mhds1yezcwEfqw&oe=6AAC048D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OmJh96gD-6wQ7kNvwHx2O6P&_nc_oc=Ado9_IS10KK3XA5R2IR7tuAKIxhSIeGo6kzmwiHvnQ_p0LvCHFDF_TdJAv9RVREIRMc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=